w-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_LOW_LetterFatherCarrion</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_LetterFatherCarrion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_LetterFatherCarrion\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c4aae84c-c9b5-4941-a94f-c5c8ead07205</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c4aae84c-c9b5-4941-a94f-c5c8ead07205\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c4aae84c-c9b5-4941-a94f-c5c8ead07205\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a Rustic Chest at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-257&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-44</span> in the atelier of <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This parchment is old, flaky, and smells faintly of tomb-musk.]\n</p><p><br>\nDearest Mssr Fevras,\n</p><p>I so appreciated the desperation of your correspondence. Heartbreak can impose such a terrible burden. In my humble role as an interlocutor with the spirit realm, I believe I might be able to offer you some reprieve.\n</p><p><br>\nBring this letter to my mansion near the seafront, and together we will see if the dead have peace to offer you.\n</p><p><br>\nYours in spirit,\n</p><p>Mystic Carrion\n</p><p><br>\nPS. The door is regrettably stubborn, so you must speak its preferred words: <i>Secreta mortuorum.</i>\n</p><p>PPS. I may even consider a discounted rate, if you're willing to recommend my services to Lady Jannath's well-coined kinfolk.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Prior to Patch 8, the name of this item and the addressee in its contents were both spelled \"Fervas\" rather than \"Fevras\".</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195241\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1871/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33585/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10119/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 933761/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.560      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.560      1 -total\n 66.98%   35.207      8 Template:Icon_text\n 61.47%   32.307     19 Template:Trim\n 30.30%   15.927      1 Template:PageSeo\n 30.16%   15.854      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.93%   14.156      2 Template:Uid\n 23.55%   12.378      2 Template:CharLink\n 22.89%   12.030      3 Template:Icon_link\n 18.59%    9.770      8 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parse